        "line-height": "120%",
        "margin-top": "6pt",
        "text-align": "justify",
        "text-indent": "22.5pt"
      },
      "table": null,
      "text": "YouTube ads revenues increased $4.2 billion from 2024 to 2025. The growth was driven by our direct response advertising products followed by our brand advertising products, both of which benefited from increased spending by our advertisers.",
      "text_hash": "667211184c3b20f2a99d677bd10b13f3abb03d7f6fa764a846f03d7044c63b44",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-000520-aa2f5d1f",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[557]",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 520,
      "reported_page": 34,
      "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_100",
      "style_signature": {
        "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
        "font-size": "10pt",
        "font-style": "italic",
        "font-weight": "400",
        "line-height": "120%",
        "margin-top": "6pt",
        "text-align": "justify",
        "text-indent": "22.5pt"
      },
      "table": null,
      "text": "Google Network",
      "text_hash": "aa2f5d1fd0575e2c11f6eb0f5402d1710fae29eaef7e18d14ed427bc003c96b4",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-000521-705e8910",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[558]",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 521,
      "reported_page": 34,
      "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_100",
      "style_signature": {
        "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
        "font-size": "10pt",
        "font-weight": "400",
        "line-height": "120%",
        "margin-top": "6pt",
        "text-align": "justify",
        "text-indent": "22.5pt"
      },
      "table": null,
      "text": "Google Network revenues decreased $567 million from 2024 to 2025, primarily due to a decrease in AdSense revenues, partially offset by an increase in AdMob revenues.",
      "text_hash": "705e8910ce15847d63d1633f2ec022e4998b13d2f32763988e170501b0a157a2",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
