      "text": "Google Search & otherPaid clicks change6 %Cost-per-click change7 %Google NetworkImpressions change(7)%Cost-per-impression change7 %",
      "text_hash": "69190ce824ed25fb730650229f7e3591c30327216a1d315a3ba671fba8f48e71",
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-000525-169fa5b0",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[562]",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 525,
      "reported_page": 34,
      "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_100",
      "style_signature": {
        "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
        "font-size": "10pt",
        "font-weight": "400",
        "line-height": "120%",
        "margin-top": "6pt",
        "text-align": "justify",
        "text-indent": "22.5pt"
      },
      "table": null,
      "text": "Changes in paid clicks and impressions are driven by a number of interrelated factors, including changes in advertiser spending; ongoing product and policy changes; and, as it relates to paid clicks, fluctuations in search queries resulting from changes in user adoption and usage, primarily on mobile devices.",
      "text_hash": "169fa5b0a7c178d6b6ac5ef9d46db099e5586d12bc5409c412aa83430859600d",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-000526-703477be",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[563]",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 526,
      "reported_page": 34,
      "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_100",
      "style_signature": {
        "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
        "font-size": "10pt",
        "font-weight": "400",
        "line-height": "120%",
        "margin-top": "6pt",
        "text-align": "justify",
        "text-indent": "22.5pt"
      },
      "table": null,
      "text": "Changes in cost-per-click and cost-per-impression are driven by a number of interrelated factors including changes in device mix, geographic mix, advertiser spending, ongoing product and policy changes, product mix, property mix, and changes in foreign currency exchange rates.",
      "text_hash": "703477be012ee7530486e9318650ce57d469837a70f6c700c9f02c1c0d0bd066",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-000527-138d1dce",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[564]",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 527,
      "reported_page": 34,
      "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_100",
      "style_signature": {
        "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
        "font-size": "10pt",
        "font-style": "italic",
        "font-weight": "400",
        "line-height": "120%",
        "margin-top": "6pt",
        "text-align": "justify",
        "text-indent": "22.5pt"
      },
      "table": null,
      "text": "Google Subscriptions, Platforms, and Devices",
      "text_hash": "138d1dce220dcfd8328b9f2b729f1d51ea11fbea0ae0f47029711686d380f3a1",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-000528-88aea9e4",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[565]",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 528,
      "reported_page": 34,
      "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_100",
      "style_signature": {
        "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
        "font-size": "10pt",
        "font-weight": "400",
        "line-height": "120%",
        "margin-top": "6pt",
        "text-align": "justify",
        "text-indent": "22.5pt"
      },
      "table": null,
      "text": "Google subscriptions, platforms, and devices revenues increased $7.7 billion from 2024 to 2025. The growth was primarily driven by an increase in subscriptions revenues. This increase was primarily due to the contribution from growth in paid subscriptions across both YouTube services and Google One.",
      "text_hash": "88aea9e41e234b248fc0f374a8269c96a527ef8c5e57db012200777cf090ed29",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-000529-69bd2211",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[566]",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 529,
      "reported_page": 34,
      "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_100",
      "style_signature": {
        "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
        "font-size": "10pt",
        "font-style": "italic",
        "font-weight": "700",
        "line-height": "120%",
        "margin-top": "6pt",
        "text-align": "justify",
        "text-indent": "22.5pt"
      },
      "table": null,
      "text": "Google Cloud",
      "text_hash": "69bd2211a05e151338291eb88add1fcdd30966b4d92a1de7f3fb651f3e5078db",
      "type": "heading_candidate"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-000530-9c1f37ab",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[567]",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 530,
      "reported_page": 34,
      "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_100",
      "style_signature": {
        "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
        "font-size": "10pt",
        "font-weight": "400",
        "line-height": "120%",
        "margin-top": "6pt",
        "text-align": "justify",
        "text-indent": "22.5pt"
      },
      "table": null,
      "text": "Google Cloud revenues increased $15.5 billion from 2024 to 2025, primarily driven by growth in Google Cloud Platform largely from infrastructure and platform services.",
      "text_hash": "9c1f37ab85524ba4a7d8d1114cc7fb16bd063a7bbdaf07920c7f7be533fd0b13",
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ],
